# Ignore patterns for research/ only. They live here, not in the root
# .gitignore, because nothing outside research/ refers to it (README rule 6).

# heavy scan intermediates; small results/*.json artifacts ARE committed
**/cache/

# LaTeX build products of the generated derivation appendices (the .tex the
# notebooks emit IS committed; the PDF and friends are rebuilt on demand)
*.pdf
# ...except the report PDFs: those are deliverables, committed so they read on GitHub
!report_*.pdf
*.aux
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.bbl
*.blg
